        "id": "tb-auth-intro",
        "moduleId": "authentication",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "身份鉴别概述",
        "markdown": "用户身份鉴别（identification & authentication）是数据库管理系统提供的最外层安全保护措施。每个用户在系统中都有一个用户标识（user identification），由用户名和用户标识号组成。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
