            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-grant",
        "moduleId": "access-control",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "GRANT语句",
        "markdown": "SQL中使用GRANT语句授予权限，基本格式为：\n\n```sql\nGRANT <权限>[,<权限>]...\nON <对象类型> <对象名>\nTO <用户>[,<用户>]...\n[WITH GRANT OPTION];\n```\n\n其中WITH GRANT OPTION允许被授权用户再将该权限转授给其他用户。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000285"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库安全性",
                "授权：授予与收回"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5333,
              "lineEnd": 5417,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/e5271fd6193d8ba0014b87c907d62857fca057bbd8d3bb6e39ee5f3d8aa5f059.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "607288e26f19c3f1ca166067f7f75720e4270c372daf19e523c708b20e7c6dcc"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-grant-example",
        "moduleId": "access-control",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "授权示例",
        "markdown": "例如，把对表SC的INSERT权限授予用户U5，并允许其转授：\n\n```sql\nGRANT INSERT\nON TABLE SC\nTO U5\nWITH GRANT OPTION;\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
